+## Context Ladder
+
+- Small/direct tasks: read this file plus the exact file or command surface.
+- Bugs, audits, support, release, UI/runtime, payment, App Store, or automation work: capture the chain before acting: background, symptom, affected systems, timeline, prior attempts, current evidence, likely causes, and required outcome.
