+
+## SOP Rating
+
+Self-ratings must cite evidence, not vibes. Note context, canonical tool use, verification, memory/handoff updates, friction/blocks, and deductions.
+
+Caps:
+- `8` max if verification was incomplete or deferred.
+- `7` max if required machine/runtime proof was missed.
+- `6` max if chain-of-events context was missed on bug/support/release work.
+- `5` max if the user had to stop a myopic or risky direction.
